 entrance is through the", "masthead_date_verified": true, "catalog_year": null, "masthead_year": 1893, "linguistic_note": "Hypothesis 4 Negative-Corpus Control: 0 hits of ballyhoo / ballahoo / billahi / Allah hoo across 5,879,738 chars of 1893-1894 Midway texts", "analysis_notes": "Quantitative 14-volume, 5,879,738-character negative-corpus sweep across contemporaneous 1893-1894 World''s Columbian Exposition Midway Plaisance guides and histories (Flinn Official Guide, Rand McNally Handbook, Bancroft Book of the Fair Parts 5/9/10, Chicago Record''s History, Shepp''s World''s Fair, Midway Types, Portrait Types, Magic City, Uncle Jeremiah, Sweet Clover, Against Odds, Peristyle to Plaisance, Dedicatory Ceremonies) yields ZERO occurrences of ballyhoo, ballahoo, billahi, or Allah hoo.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/ballyhoo/CERT-1800-213.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1893 (on or before Dec. 31, 1930); in the United States public domain as of Jan. 1, 2026. WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
