fically the intransitive infinitive ''to bally on front'' — proving back-clipping ''ballyhoo -> bally'' occurred inside traveling sideshow classifieds by Aug. 1906.", "analysis_notes": "Verified on Aug. 18, 1906 Billboard masthead and p. 46 classified notice. .", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/ballyhoo/CERT-1800-119.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1906 (on or before Dec. 31, 1930); in the United States public domain as of Jan. 1, 2026. WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
