th": "/scans/gimmick/CERT-1100-111.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1896 (on or before Dec. 31, 1930); in the United States public domain as of Jan. 1, 2026."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
