eir to Soapy Smith''s Denver/Skagway gang and Jack Mabray''s Denver branch store.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/grifter/CERT-2100-224.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1923 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
