true, "catalog_year": 1899, "masthead_year": 1991, "linguistic_note": "", "analysis_notes": "IA item bwb_P9-DTM-234 carries catalog metadata ''year: 1899'' under the classic title The Five-Foot Shelf of Books (imitating 19th/early-20th-century Harvard Classics bindings). Inspection of leaf 204 reveals a 1990 Hollywood movie roundup citing Stephen Frears''s 1990 adaptation of Jim Thompson''s 1963 noir novel The Grifters alongside David Lynch''s Wild at Heart (1990), and colophon leaf 353 explicitly prints ''Published by C. Editions New York, N.Y. Copyright A. Ruppersberg, 1991'' (with a 2000 obituary clipping bound below). Classic Trap D modern imprint masquerading behind an antiquarian binding/title.", "scan": {"hosted_path": null, "rights_status": "post_1930_external_archive_link", "rights_note": "Published 1991 (> 1930, cataloged under 1899 in Internet Archive): modern copyrighted work; scan not bundled in public pack—verify via external archive URL."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
