e ''say, bo'' (all 178 raw OCR hits for ''say bo'' were OCR ghosts for ''to be'' / ''says he''), showing standalone vocative ''bo'' was maritime/regional before 1889.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/hobo/CERT-2300-308.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1867 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
