Hose''->''Hobo'' (Savannah 1887), ''Globe''->''Hobo'' (Sandersville GA 1886 ''Brass Globe Valves''), ''House''->''Hobo'' (Ogden 1888, Lancaster 1889), ''Hobb''s''->''Hobo''s'' (LA 1889-01-01), ''Mono''->''Hobo'' (Reno 1889), ''Robert''->''Hobo t'' (Walker Lake NV 1889), and ''sobbed''/''Robbed''->''hoboed'' (Boston 1890, Decatur 1895-1896).", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/hobo/CERT-2300-128.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1885 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
