cal differentiation.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/hobo/CERT-2300-208.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1888 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
