1, letter dated June 8, 1891). Contrast 0 non-Hoboken hits across 9 full volumes of Locomotive Firemen''s Magazine (1884-1892) and Switchmen''s Journal Vol. 1 (1886), showing brotherhood journals adopted ''hobo'' from Western vernacular rather than coining it in technical railroad print.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/hobo/CERT-2300-117.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1891 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
