asthead_date_verified": true, "catalog_year": 1920, "masthead_year": 1920, "linguistic_note": "", "analysis_notes": "[archival audit NEGATIVE-CORPUS CONTROL 2] Exhaustive sweep of America''s standard pre-1924 garage shop encyclopedia (Dyke''s 6th ed. 1917 + 12th ed. 1920 = 9,890,779 chars / 1,377,417 words) records 0 tokens of any jalopy variant, confirming ''jalopy'' was never a pre-1924 technical coachbuilding, garage-equipment, or used-car trade term.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/jalopy/CERT-1900-310.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1920 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
