ts in 1861 for a quartermaster''s or soldier''s shanty/outfit", "analysis_notes": "Second 1860 New York Clipper primary-scan-verified attestation (-2y vs. 1862 baseline), explicitly equating ''One of the concert saloons (the Pagoda)'' in Baltimore with ''the Shebang'' on the New York-Baltimore theatrical circuit.", "scan": {"hosted_path": "/scans/whole-shebang/CERT-2000-109.webp", "rights_status": "us_public_domain_pre_1931", "rights_note": "Published 1860 (<= 1930): public domain in the United States; WebP proof scan hosted directly."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
