; scan paywalled on NewspaperArchive, logged as BASELINE-LITERATURE). Shows broadened institutional sense (''boss of this \"chebang\"'') in Cincinnati two weeks before Civil War mobilization.", "scan": {"hosted_path": null, "rights_status": "external_archive_link", "rights_note": "Published 1861 (<= 1930): inspect original scan via host archive URL."}}', '2026-11-27T05:35:25Z');
